{"projectInfo":{"name":"OSPF Stub区域配置举例（交换）","path":"ospfstub","visibility":2,"categoryId":6280,"introduction":"所有的交换机都运行OSPF，整个自治系统划分为3个区域。其中SWA和SWB作为ABR来转发区域之间的路由，SW D作为ASBR引入了外部路由（静态路由）。要求将Area1配置为Stub区域，减少通告到此区域内的LSA数量，但不影响路由的可达性。。","label":["OSPF","Stub区域"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"SWA","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SWA.cfg"},{"resourceName":"SWC","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SWC.cfg"},{"resourceName":"SWB","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SWB.cfg"},{"resourceName":"SWD","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\SWD.cfg"},{"resourceName":"S6850_6","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\S6850_6.cfg"},{"resourceName":"S6850_5","resourceCategory":"交换机","resourceModel":"S6850","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.070-A7170","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\S6850_5.cfg"}]}